rm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{add}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mul}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\mathrm{mul}(a,0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{mul}(a,b+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{add}(\\mathrm{mul}(a,b),a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mul}(a,b)=ab,\\qquad\\mathrm{mul}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.","display":true}],"bytes":707,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$a,i\\in\\mathbb N$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$ 是整个调用环境中的固定参数；$\\beta:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 为下式定义的函数，公开接口仍只有 $a,i$ 两个参数。$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem},\\mathrm{fact},\\pi_i^n$ 分别取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-divrem-function]]、[[57-df-factorial-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$\\mathrm{PR}$、复合及原始递归取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]。"},{"id":"712165bc47a6ac48","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}$ 是下式定义的截断减法。"},{"id":"c39eb67536237339","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{mul}$ 取 [[57-df-multiplication-function]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_1$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem